        // box instead of sized down. Exactly one scroll container per face
        // (.front-content / .back-content) is the whole system; the ONLY
        // other scrollbar this file ever creates is the word's own frozen
        // slot, and only as the very last resort below.
        function shrinkToFit(el) {
